{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 80,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9634399414062,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "care system. Challenges with producing a sufficient quality and quantity of sputum are well",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        358.918701171875,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "documented and can lead to repeat testing or false results.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        110.17292785644531,
        156.2059326171875,
        126.55293273925781
      ],
      "text": "Acceptability",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        136.8038330078125,
        526.9810180664062,
        149.94883728027344
      ],
      "text": "Most participants, including health workers and caregivers, did not immediately understand",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        152.3038330078125,
        526.98095703125,
        165.44883728027344
      ],
      "text": "why multiple samples would be tested concurrently at the same visit, if a respiratory sample is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        167.8038330078125,
        526.9478759765625,
        180.94883728027344
      ],
      "text": "available. They highlighted that a sputum sample is the preferred choice, and they would only",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        183.3038330078125,
        527.0030517578125,
        196.44883728027344
      ],
      "text": "collect the second-best sample if that were not available. However, participants also thought",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        198.8038330078125,
        527.3056640625,
        211.94883728027344
      ],
      "text": "that concurrent sample testing could be possible if there was a WHO recommendation, altered",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.973518371582031,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        214.3038330078125,
        527.1532592773438,
        227.44883728027344
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic algorithms and specific training and capacity strengthening to facilitate it (see  Web",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984990119934082,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.8038330078125,
        136.68951416015625,
        242.94883728027344
      ],
      "text": "). Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        253.8077392578125,
        526.8729858398438,
        266.9527587890625
      ],
      "text": "For young children, stool seems to be an acceptable specimen, especially after adequate training",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.3077392578125,
        526.96240234375,
        282.4527587890625
      ],
      "text": "in how to process it. Stool from adults is considered more difficult in terms of both acceptance",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        284.8077392578125,
        526.9645385742188,
        297.9527587890625
      ],
      "text": "and processing time. In general, participants had confidence in the results from stool tested",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.3077392578125,
        256.7748107910156,
        313.4527587890625
      ],
      "text": "by GeneXpert (see  ). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.8193359375,
        136.2740936279297,
        342.1993103027344
      ],
      "text": "Feasibility",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        352.4503173828125,
        526.6019287109375,
        365.5953369140625
      ],
      "text": "Important feasibility challenges are related to the deteriorating quality of stool, caused by delays",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.9503173828125,
        519.2293701171875,
        381.0953369140625
      ],
      "text": "between time of collection and time of processing in the laboratory (see  ). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        391.9542236328125,
        526.9458618164062,
        405.0992431640625
      ],
      "text": "Concurrent testing needs to be framed as a more efficient way of working (i.e. testing two",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        407.4542236328125,
        526.9478759765625,
        420.5992431640625
      ],
      "text": "samples concurrently during the same visit, instead of testing one sample during each of two",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.9542236328125,
        527.2330932617188,
        436.0992431640625
      ],
      "text": "separate visits) that also allows increasing access and reducing costs for patients. The practice of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.957417488098145,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.4542236328125,
        526.993896484375,
        451.5992431640625
      ],
      "text": "concurrent testing needs to be framed as generating sufficient benefit to justify the additional",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.991847038269043,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.9542236328125,
        527.1022338867188,
        467.0992431640625
      ],
      "text": "short-term workload and having the potential to reduce the workload in the longer term.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        469.4542236328125,
        526.9713134765625,
        482.5992431640625
      ],
      "text": "Without such framing, there is a risk that already overburdened health care workers will avoid",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.999750137329102,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.9542236328125,
        279.2471008300781,
        498.0992431640625
      ],
      "text": "concurrent testing (see  ). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        508.958251953125,
        526.9959716796875,
        522.103271484375
      ],
      "text": "Prior investments made in frontrunner technologies, donor preferences, limited health systems",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.972515106201172,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        524.458251953125,
        526.9479370117188,
        537.603271484375
      ],
      "text": "thinking and unnecessary competition between manufacturers all pose challenges to policy",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        539.958251953125,
        527.1150512695312,
        553.103271484375
      ],
      "text": "adoption and implementation of novel molecular diagnostics. In addition, national in-country",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998700141906738,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        555.458251953125,
        526.6863403320312,
        568.603271484375
      ],
      "text": "health technology and cost-efficacy assessments can delay decisions to implement newer",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        570.958251953125,
        493.9747009277344,
        584.103271484375
      ],
      "text": "technologies and diagnostic strategies using different samples (see  ). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.9620971679688,
        527.195068359375,
        608.1071166992188
      ],
      "text": "More information on the qualitative evidence analysis and synthesis for concurrent use of tests",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.982335090637207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        610.4620971679688,
        297.133544921875,
        623.6071166992188
      ],
      "text": "in children is available from  Web Annex B.10.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.9736938476562,
        275.1541442871094,
        652.3536987304688
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        662.6046142578125,
        78.81909942626953,
        675.7496337890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        662.6046142578125,
        526.8970336914062,
        675.7496337890625
      ],
      "text": "Concurrent testing maximizes diagnostic opportunity and accuracy of case detection, is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        678.1046142578125,
        526.9654541015625,
        691.2496337890625
      ],
      "text": "a more efficient way to address the needs of this population and is preferred even if the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        693.6046142578125,
        237.1345977783203,
        706.7496337890625
      ],
      "text": "testing workload may increase.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        709.1046142578125,
        78.81909942626953,
        722.2496337890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        709.1046142578125,
        407.83990478515625,
        722.2496337890625
      ],
      "text": "A positive result on either test is sufficient to confirm TB diagnosis.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        724.6046142578125,
        78.81909942626953,
        737.7496337890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        724.6046142578125,
        526.6121826171875,
        737.7496337890625
      ],
      "text": "Patient loss to follow-up for the second test result should be monitored and prevented.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        740.1046142578125,
        526.9556274414062,
        753.2496337890625
      ],
      "text": "Patients should be provided with information to understand the concurrent testing approach",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        755.6046142578125,
        220.2732696533203,
        768.7496337890625
      ],
      "text": "and the need for follow-up.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "64 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}